<title>TUNISIA: Tunisia's foreign reserves rise slightly.</title>
<headline>Tunisia's foreign reserves rise slightly.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tunisia's total foreign exchange reserves rose slightly, by eight million dinars to 1.377 billion, at July 31, compared to 1.369 billion dinars on May 10, Central Bank figures showed.</p>
<p>    Details (rounded)    July 31    May 10	  Dec 31, 1995</p>
<p>Assets (Dinar millions)</p>
<p>    Gold			   4	    4		   5</p>
<p>    Foreign		  1,342	1,350	     1,525</p>
<p>    SDRs			  31	   15		  12</p>
<p>($=0.97 dinar)</p>
</text>
